Thoron: About page shows the Chromium base version, the disclaimer and the release notes.

Thoron versions widen Chromium's last number (patch x 100 + rebuild, see tools/release/version.py in the
Thoron repository), so the About page also shows the Chromium version a build is based on. When
chrome/VERSION carries THORON_REBUILD, the Chromium patch is the last number divided by 100; otherwise
the version is shown as it is. The page also shows the disclaimer verbatim and links to the release notes.

Origin: Thoron
Author: KuchiSofts
License: BSD-3-Clause

